This is an independent Rust reimplementation of a subset of Cordis semantics.
It is not an official Cordis, DeepSeek, or Verus distribution.

Design and behavior references:
- Cordis, https://github.com/cordiverse/cordis (MIT)
- DeepSeek Harness, https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness (MIT)
- A Programming Paradigm for Spatiotemporal Composability,
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.25512v1 (https://github.com/Stool233/cordis-verus/blob/main/reference/README.md)

The ignored upstream checkouts retain their own license and copyright files.
The reference paper is not covered by this project's MIT license.
Verus binaries and vstd retain their upstream licenses. Binary archives are
downloaded into the ignored .tools directory; they are not redistributed here.

